    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f2221539377f1292c8eabcf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在她的双眼深处，正闪烁着冰冷的光芒。\r\n这双眼，看起来就像是在以难以计算的速度飞快\r\n地计算着什么似的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7dd69a6bccf5502ebf8622b0ce1e818b8398e96508673d466741dfe9a2969d2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105200.json",
      "json_path": [
