    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d762ea003cdd9baed1c0698c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "デビュー戦にむけて",
      "source_fingerprint": "c88c627d5fad2a0656ad0aaeb8c014e4b43e87a2a69d71976076b9249b092434",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105200.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e76dd67845f7cac939e8a90e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "经典三冠初战，『皋月赏』。\r\n而新宇宙所面对的宿敌——",
      "source_fingerprint": "5435aa8aa0652940002f1a33c9fb7b896b9dcd97a2483f5bf680a93924ee876e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105201.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47853dd185a25b92af88270e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——并非是某位赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad68ce7ce6249b6b904ed75ba21139316c1252b20b5649ab787d2bba33b6b4e2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105201.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29804ce5fcdd25bfd4435916",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "某位训练员",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8f9894d3efc7f95a83db8bb53fd4c67f978cb9b48fd76f49113fff795d1b218",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105201.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d86a2223449af6df82c0f40",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而且……\r\n其实在你之前，\r\n有位赛马娘也说过想和我签约。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1ff8299cfb84174b2ff5b9afb75b1ae585760cef3b718f3c85a5d78ed152964",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105201.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2fb849cb51378274397ba99f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "某位训练员",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8f9894d3efc7f95a83db8bb53fd4c67f978cb9b48fd76f49113fff795d1b218",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105201.json",
      "json_path": [
