    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a9adcb040b29fd73b7a37c2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我也想尽到自己对她的人情……\r\n所以说，\r\n如果我必须从你们两位中作出选择的话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7750151029ef79662fb112880f7ef77ec92b9ac235b535b57deb54a31e45807e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105201.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9f8e624948b680dcf2a6f0b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "经新宇宙这么一说，我立刻想了起来。\r\n这个人，就是在我之前因有约在先而没能和新宇\r\n宙签订训练合约的训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ad2cbad50252d86915a040574ce0f3d2ca1d555f0743f911ec9823400fd205f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105201.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0f161cf872a2b358a61fc5e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你的签约赛马娘也参加『皋月赏』了？",
      "source_fingerprint": "afae82daaaeee8d67af3705f6e4d5c79772f7ac0f2634848a15da5919e5235f1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105201.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b001581679f35f89239c26d9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "既然这位训练员特地来我们这儿打招呼，\r\n也就是说……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8189050f3208d25fffac89e555aad62cd752332609161ec7c39adb27c29736cf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105201.json",
      "json_path": [
