    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca3b08bae64a3e0d3d8625fa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是的。我认为她已经做好了万全准备……\r\n在此之前，她也赢过数场重赏赛了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "21af4b0e3e693f1ba058ef5b062e063bfead927d59e14e87f55536c41aa29900",
